# 264. API Contract Standard

Seluruh endpoint akademik menggunakan format response yang konsisten.

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Success",
  "data": {},
  "meta": {
    "page": 1,
    "limit": 20,
    "total": 100,
    "hasNext": true
  }
}
```

